{
  "info": {
    "name": "TicketYa — Entrega 2",
    "description": "Esqueleto de la colección de la Entrega 2 (tareas 2.8 y 10.2). Todo entra por el gateway con JWT.\n\nUso:\n1. Levantar el stack (docker compose -f TP-TicketYa/docker-compose.yml up --build) o, para Auth y Seguridad, solo el gateway.\n2. Correr primero la carpeta Auth: guarda los tokens en variables de colección.\n3. Cada dueño completa su carpeta usando Authorization: Bearer {{tokenClient}} (o el rol que corresponda). No se usan más los headers X-User-*.\n\nUsuarios demo (contraseña en passwordDemo): admin, organizador, cliente y acceso@ticketya.test.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080"
    },
    {
      "key": "passwordDemo",
      "value": "demo"
    },
    {
      "key": "emailAdmin",
      "value": "admin@ticketya.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "emailOrganizer",
      "value": "organizador@ticketya.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "emailClient",
      "value": "cliente@ticketya.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "emailAccess",
      "value": "acceso@ticketya.test"
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAdmin",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenOrganizer",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenClient",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "tokenAccess",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Login con JWT. Correr primero: guarda tokenAdmin, tokenOrganizer, tokenClient y tokenAccess como variables de colección.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login ADMIN",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('responde 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "var body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('trae token y rol', function () { pm.expect(body.token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty; pm.expect(body.role).to.eql('ADMIN'); });",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenAdmin', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{emailAdmin}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{passwordDemo}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login ORGANIZER",
